<title>SWEDEN: Swedbank could buy five pct of Handlowy.</title>
<headline>Swedbank could buy five pct of Handlowy.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Swedbank said on Thursday it signed a letter of understanding saying it is interested in buying up to five percent of shares in Bank Handlowy of Poland, which will be privatised in June.</p>
</text>
